    <detaileddescription>
<para>gives exactly the same answers as <ref refid="classMR_1_1InSphereTesterSoS" kindref="compound">InSphereTesterSoS</ref>, only faster: the sphere&apos;s center is also computed in floating point during <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga1855670ce694c01ac7166e9562dc5ffb" kindref="member">reset()</ref>, and every query point far enough from the sphere&apos;s surface is answered by it alone, leaving the exact predicates for the points close to it </para>
